# Pinned downloads for deploy/install.sh (brief 30 §2 rule 2: version + sha256, never "latest").
# k3s values are copied from os/versions.lock.yaml; deploy/check-pins.py (CI: ci-deploy.yml)
# fails if they drift. Every other value records where its sha256 was read.
# shellcheck shell=sh disable=SC2034

